05:17.460 --> 05:21.680
And this brings us to a terrifying mathematical concept outlined in the paper, which is the bounded

05:21.680 --> 05:22.880
arbitrariness theorem.

05:23.020 --> 05:23.740
Yes, this is key.

05:23.940 --> 05:27.160
The paper actually proves that this variance isn't just human bias.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.280
It's actually a feature of the math itself.

05:29.280 --> 05:34.840
Yeah, the theorem formally demonstrates that because the statistical estimator is a continuous

